{"name":"Curious Chipmunk","hex":"#dabfa4","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"curious","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Tending to ask questions, or to want to explore or investigate; inquisitive;  nosy, prying.","Caused by curiosity."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Containing or pertaining to trivalent curium."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/curious"},{"term":"chipmunk","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of certain the small, striped rodents, all found in North America, with the exception of the Siberian chipmunk, placed in the taxonomic subtribe Tamiina."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To speed up (an audio recording, especially a song), to make the voices high-pitched.","To fill (one's mouth or cheeks) with food."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/chipmunk"}],"entries":[{"title":"Curiosity","blocks":[{"text":"Curiosity can be a quality related to inquisitive thinking, such as exploration, investigation, and learning, evident in humans and other animals. It can also refer to something which can cause curiosity. When it is for an object it may be called a curio, and a collection of curios or curiosities may be stored together as a collection called curiosities."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Kom%C3%A9ta_C-2020_F3_%28NEOWISE%29.jpg/330px-Kom%C3%A9ta_C-2020_F3_%28NEOWISE%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Curiosity"},{"title":"Chipmunk","blocks":[{"text":"Chipmunks are small, striped burrowing squirrels of subtribe Tamiina. Chipmunks are found in North America, with the exception of the Siberian chipmunk, which is found primarily in Asia. The name \"chipmunk\" originated in the 19th century, and other names for this group of squirrels include chitmunk, chipmuck, chipping squirrel, and ground squirrel, though the last name can refer to squirrels of other genera."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Chipmunk_with_stuffed_cheeks_in_Prospect_Park_%2805980%29.jpg/330px-Chipmunk_with_stuffed_cheeks_in_Prospect_Park_%2805980%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chipmunk"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Fotothek_df_roe-neg_0006464_003_Sch%C3%BCler%2C_eine_Zeitung_lesend_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Fotothek_df_roe-neg_0006464_003_Sch%C3%BCler%2C_eine_Zeitung_lesend_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Fotothek_df_roe-neg_0006464_003_Sch%C3%BCler%2C_eine_Zeitung_lesend_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Fotothek_df_roe-neg_0006464_003_Sch%C3%BCler%2C_eine_Zeitung_lesend_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A child looking to see what another is reading","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFotothek_df_roe-neg_0006464_003_Sch%C3%BCler%2C_eine_Zeitung_lesend_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Apple_IIGS_Mystery_House_Adventure_Game_Fan_Fair_Tacoma_2024.jpg/500px-Apple_IIGS_Mystery_House_Adventure_Game_Fan_Fair_Tacoma_2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Apple_IIGS_Mystery_House_Adventure_Game_Fan_Fair_Tacoma_2024.jpg/1280px-Apple_IIGS_Mystery_House_Adventure_Game_Fan_Fair_Tacoma_2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Apple_IIGS_Mystery_House_Adventure_Game_Fan_Fair_Tacoma_2024.jpg/500px-Apple_IIGS_Mystery_House_Adventure_Game_Fan_Fair_Tacoma_2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Mystery House, an adventur